[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[33A\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> /egm:egm-draft @[concepts_brief.md] target docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 26.0s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial hypothesis: relevant documentation might be located within the plugin configuration or...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(concepts_brief.md)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[31m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(find /Users/brett/.gemini -name \"execution_instructions.md\" -o -name \"design_doc.md\" 2>/dev/null)\u001b[m \u001b[37mfailed\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 3 files \u001b[37m(execution_instructions.md, design_doc.md, execution_instructions.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 13s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  I have ingested \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk87d821d1d11c20e6;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/concepts_brief.md\u0007concepts_brief.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 as the predecessor conte"]
[0.000, "o", "xt for drafting the design document targeting\r\n  \u001b[94mdocs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Context Verification\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mAuthor\u001b[m: Brett Morgan\n\u001b[20D\u001b[1mScope\u001b[m: Out-of-tree Apache NuttX custom board support package (\u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/\u001b[m) and built-in user-\r\n  space application (\u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/apps/bargraph/\u001b[m) for the Seeed Studio XIAO RP2350 with zero modifications to\r\n  \u001b[94mnuttx/\u001b[m or \u001b[94mapps/\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mHardware Mapping\u001b[m:\r\n      • Potentiometer input on \u001b[94mD0/A0\u001b[m (\u001b[94mGPIO26\u001b[m, \u001b[94m/dev/adc0\u001b[m channel 0).\r\n\tSix active-high LEDs on \u001b[94mD1\u001b[m–\u001b[94mD6\u001b[m (\u001b[94mGPIO27\u001b[m/\u001b[94mPWM5B\u001b[m, \u001b[94mGPIO28\u001b[m/\u001b[94mPWM6A\u001b[m, \u001b[94mGPIO5\u001b[m/\u001b[94mPWM2B\u001b[m, \u001b[94mGPIO6\u001b[m/\u001b[94mPWM3A\u001b[m, \u001b[94mGPIO7\u001b[m/\u001b[94mPWM3B\u001b[m,\n\u001b[99D\u001b[94mGPIO0\u001b[m/\u001b[94mPWM0A\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mKey Architectural & Driver Constraints\u001b[m:\r\n      • Enable \u001b[94mCONFIG_BOARD_LATE_INITIALIZE=y\u001b[m and dual multi-channel PWM Kconfig symbols (\u001b[94mCONFIG_PWM_MULTICHAN=y\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[6C\u001b[94mCONFIG_PWM_NCHANNELS=2\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCONFIG_RP23XX_PWM_MULTICHAN=y\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCONFIG_RP23XX_PWM_NCHANNELS=2\u001b[m) with unused sibling pins\r\n\u001b[6Cset to \u001b[94m-1\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[10D• Populate both \u001b[94mchannels[0]\u001b[m (channel 1 / pin A) and \u001b[94mchannels[1]\u001b[m (channel 2 / pin B) on multi-channel PWM slices,\r\n\u001b[6Cscale duty strictly within \u001b[94m0..65535\u001b[m (\u001b[94muint16_t\u001b[m), and zero duty before \u001b[94mPWMIOC_STOP\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[81D• Enable\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[12D\u001b[?2026l"]
