[0.000, "o", "CHAN=y\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCONFIG_RP23XX_PWM_NCHANNELS=2\u001b[m) with unused sibling pins\r\n\u001b[6Cset to \u001b[94m-1\u001b[m.\n\u001b[10D• Populate both \u001b[94mchannels[0]\u001b[m (channel 1 / pin A) and \u001b[94mchannels[1]\u001b[m (channel 2 / pin B) on multi-channel PWM slices,\r\n\u001b[6Cscale duty strictly within \u001b[94m0..65535\u001b[m (\u001b[94muint16_t\u001b[m), and zero duty before \u001b[94mPWMIOC_STOP\u001b[m.\n\u001b[81D• Enable only \u001b[94mCONFIG_RP23XX_ADC_CHANNEL0=y\u001b[m, configure \u001b[94mRP23XX_PADS_BANK0_GPIO(26)\u001b[m (\u001b[94mIE=0\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPUE=0\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPDE=0\u001b[m, \u001b[94mISO=0\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mOD=1\u001b[m) for Erratum RP2350-E9, pace hardware conversions via \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_DIV = 0xFFFF00\u001b[m (\u001b[94m~732 Hz\u001b[m), flush stale\r\n\u001b[6CFIFO samples with \u001b[94mANIOC_RESET_FIFO\u001b[m, and right-shift \u001b[94mam_data >> 19\u001b[m.\n\u001b[66D• Spawn \u001b[94mbargraphd\u001b[m autonomously from \u001b[94mrp23xx_bringup()\u001b[m before USB-C NSH console initialization, and provide the\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mbargraph\u001b[m CLI (\u001b[94mstart\u001b[m, \u001b[94mstop\u001b[m, \u001b[94mstatus\u001b[m, \u001b[94mtest\u001b[m, \u001b[94mset <0..100>\u001b[m, \u001b[94mresume\u001b[m) over shared flat-memory state gu"]
[0.001, "o", "arded by\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mpthread_mutex_t\u001b[m and \u001b[94mpthread_cond_t\u001b[m.\n\u001b[35D• Integrate \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/apps\u001b[m into the build via an ignored \u001b[94mapps/external\u001b[m symlink managed in \u001b[94mxiao-\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mrp2350-bargraph/board/scripts/Make.defs\u001b[m.\r\n  • \u001b[1mDrafting Workflow\u001b[m: Iterative section drafting in \u001b[94mdesign_draft.md\u001b[m, followed by final reconciliation and output to\r\n  \u001b[94mdocs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md\u001b[m.\r\n\n  Please confirm whether we can begin Step 2 (drafting Overview, The Problem, Goals, Non-Goals, Open Questions, and\r\n  Critical User Journeys in \u001b[94mdesign_draft.md\u001b[m).\r\n\n\u001b[33;1m?\u001b[m Confirm context from concepts_brief.md and start drafting design_draft.md?\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Proceed to Step 2 and draft Overview, Goals & Problem Statement in design_draft.md\u001b[m\r\n⢿  \u001b[90mWorking\u001b[94m...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
