[0.000, "o", " guards, 16-bit \u001b[94muint16_t\u001b[m duty truncation at \u001b[94mb16ONE\u001b[m,\r\n  frozen output state on \u001b[94mPWMIOC_STOP\u001b[m, ADC pin-mux reset + RP2350-E9 pad leakage, and 500 kS/s free-running ADC FIFO\r\n  staleness).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mMeasurable Goals & Scope Boundaries\u001b[m: Specified the 50 Hz sampling pipeline (\u001b[94mANIOC_RESET_FIFO\u001b[m, 4-sample burst\r\n  average, EMA filter, endpoint deadbands, and \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_DIV = 0xFFFF00\u001b[m), 6-segment proportional PWM scaling (\u001b[94m0..\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m65535\u001b[m), autonomous power-on launch from \u001b[94mrp23xx_bringup()\u001b[m, and strict non-modification of \u001b[94mnuttx/\u001b[m and \u001b[94mapps/\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mCritical User Journeys\u001b[m: Defined three end-to-end journeys covering standalone power-on potentiometer tracking,\r\n  live \u001b[94mbargraph status\u001b[m telemetry over USB-C NSH, and manual override (\u001b[94mset\u001b[m), sweep verification (\u001b[94mtest\u001b[m), \u001b[94mresume\u001b[m, and\r\n  zeroed-duty shutdown (\u001b[94mstop\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  Please review \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk786798bfe1f9d130;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHu"]
