[0.033, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[33A• \u001b[1mProblem Framing Around Upstream RP23xx Constraints\u001b[m: Documented the seven concrete hardware and driver issues in\r\n  \u001b[94mnuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx\u001b[m and \u001b[94mapps/nshlib/nsh_usbconsole.c\u001b[m (missing \u001b[94mCONFIG_BOARD_LATE_INITIALIZE=y\u001b[m, USB CDC/ACM\u001b[K\r\n  console blocking, \u001b[94mpwm_info_s\u001b[m channel indexing and dual Kconfig guards, 16-bit \u001b[94muint16_t\u001b[m duty truncation at \u001b[94mb16ONE\u001b[m,\r\n  frozen output state on \u001b[94mPWMIOC_STOP\u001b[m, ADC pin-mux reset + RP2350-E9 pad leakage, and 500 kS/s free-running ADC FIFO\r\n  staleness).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mMeasurable Goals & Scope Boundaries\u001b[m: Specified the 50 Hz sampling pipeline (\u001b[94mANIOC_RESET_FIFO\u001b[m, 4-sample burst\r\n  average, EMA filter, endpoint deadbands, and \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_DIV = 0xFFFF00\u001b[m), 6-segment proportional PWM scaling (\u001b[94m0..\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m65535\u001b[m), autonomous power-on launch from \u001b[94mrp23xx_bringup()\u001b[m, and strict non-modification of \u001b[94mnuttx/\u001b[m and \u001b[94mapps/\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mCritical User Journeys\u001b[m: Defined three en"]
[0.000, "o", "d-to-end journeys covering standalone power-on potentiometer tracking,\r\n  live \u001b[94mbargraph status\u001b[m telemetry over USB-C NSH, and manual override (\u001b[94mset\u001b[m), sweep verification (\u001b[94mtest\u001b[m), \u001b[94mresume\u001b[m, and\r\n  zeroed-duty shutdown (\u001b[94mstop\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  Please review \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk786798bfe1f9d130;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/design_draft.md\u0007design_draft.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and let me know how you would like to proceed.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33;1m?\u001b[m Drafted Overview & Goals in design_draft.md. Please review. How would you like to proceed?\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Approve Overview & Goals and proceed to next section\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 4m 34s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial hypothesis: a configuration issue in `Make.defs` may be causing build failures. Inves...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 33 files \u001b[37m(defconfig, board.h, rp23xx_bringup.c, +30)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[60D\u001b[33;1mdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(design_draft.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 7s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  I have added the \u001b[1m"]
