[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[32A\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 4m 34s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial hypothesis: a configuration issue in `Make.defs` may be causing build failures. Inves...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 33 files \u001b[37m(defconfig, board.h, rp23xx_bringup.c, +30)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[60D\u001b[33;1mdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(design_draft.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 7s, 88 tokens\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  I have added the \u001b[1mTechnical Plan (Architecture)\u001b[m section to \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk11eca334b86c7d37;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/design_draft.md\u0007design_draft.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Key Decisions & Additions\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOut-of-Tree Build & Symlink Integration\u001b[m: Detailed how \u001b[94mCONFIG_ARCH_BOARD_CUSTOM\u001b[m links \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/board\u001b[m\r\n  alongside \u001b[94mnuttx/boards/arm/rp23xx/common\u001b[m, and how \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/scripts/Make.defs\u001b[m creates the git-\u001b[K\r\n  ignored \u001b[94mapps/external -> ../xiao-rp2350-bargraph/apps\u001b[m symlink while keeping \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/apps/"]
[0.000, "o", "Kconfig\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  persistent across \u001b[94mmake distclean\u001b[m by omitting \u001b[94mMENUDESC\u001b[m in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/apps/Makefile\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mHardware Topology, Boot Sequence, and RP2350 Driver Mitigations\u001b[m: Added the pin mapping table, 400-tie-point\r\n  breadboard diagram, electrical current budget (\u001b[94m~3.94 mA\u001b[m/LED, \u001b[94m~23.6 mA\u001b[m total), boot sequence diagram showing\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mbargraph_autostart()\u001b[m running in \u001b[94mrp23xx_bringup()\u001b[m ahead of \u001b[94mnsh_waitusbready()\u001b[m, ADC mitigations\u001b[K\r\n  (\u001b[94mCONFIG_RP23XX_ADC_CHANNEL0=y\u001b[m only, \u001b[94mRP23XX_PADS_BANK0_GPIO(26)\u001b[m RP2350-E9 pad isolation, \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_DIV = 0xFFFF00\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m~732 Hz\u001b[m pacing, \u001b[94mANIOC_RESET_FIFO\u001b[m, \u001b[94m>> 19\u001b[m shift, Q4 EMA filter, and deadbands), and PWM mitigations (dual Kconfig\u001b[K\r\n  guards, unused sibling pins \u001b[94m-1\u001b[m, two-channel \u001b[94mpwm_info_s\u001b[m population, \u001b[94m0..65535\u001b[m duty math, and zeroing duty before\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mPWMIOC_STOP\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mDaemon State Machine & CLI Synchronization\u001b[m: D"]
