[0.099, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\n\n\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[35A\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 50.8s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(I'm thinking through how to approach this.)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(design_draft.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 13s, 92 tokens\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  I have added the \u001b[1mAlternatives Considered\u001b[m section (along with \u001b[94mNon-Functional Requirements\u001b[m, \u001b[94mAdditional Resources\u001b[m, and\r\n  \u001b[94mFuture Improvements\u001b[m) to \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfe31f974fb2b8c37;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/design_draft.md\u0007design_draft.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Key Decisions & Additions\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mFour Evaluated Alternatives with Technical Rationales\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[1mAlternative A (Discrete On/Off GPIO Bar Graph)\u001b[m: Rejected by author in favor of proportional hardware PWM\r\n\u001b[6Cbrightness modulation on the active segment (\u001b[94m0..65535\u001b[m).\u001b[K\n\u001b[55D• \u001b[1mAlternative B (Foreground \u001b[94;22mINIT_ENTRYPOINT=\"bargraph_main\"\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Rejected by author so \u001b[94mnsh_main\u001b[m continues to serve\r\n\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[6Cthe interactive USB-C CDC/ACM console while \u001b[94mbargraphd\u001b[m runs in the background.\u001b[K\n\u001b[77D• \u001b[1mAlternative C (ROMFS \u001b[94;22m/etc/init.d/rcS\u001b[39;1m Startup Only)\u001b[m: Rejected by author because \u001b[94mnsh_usbconsole.c\u001b[m blocks inside\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mnsh_waitusbready()\u001b[m until a USB host sends three newline/carriage-return bytes, and \u001b[94mBoard.mk\u001b[m ROMFS generation\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Crequires host \u001b[94mgenromfs\u001b[m and \u001b[94mxxd\u001b[m binaries.\u001b[K\n\u001b[40D• \u001b[1mAlternative D (Single \u001b[94;22mstart\u001b[39;1m Command Without \u001b[94;22mresume\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Rejected by author in favor of supporting both \u001b[94mbargraph\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mresume\u001b[m and \u001b[94mbargraph start\u001b[m to return from \u001b[94mMANUAL\u001b[m override mode to \u001b[94mSENSING\u001b[m mode.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mNon-Functional Requirements\u001b[m: Quantified the \u001b[94m99.85%\u001b[m ADC interrupt rate reduction (\u001b[94m500 kS/s\u001b[m down to \u001b[94m~732.42 Hz\u001b[m), \u001b[94m<\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m1%\u001b[m CPU budget at \u001b[94m50 Hz\u001b[m, electrical current bounds (\u001b[94m~3.94 mA\u001b[m/LED, \u001b[94m~23.6 mA\u001b[m total), and clean git status invari"]
[0.000, "o", "ants\u001b[K\r\n  for \u001b[94mnuttx/\u001b[m and \u001b[94mapps/\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  Please review \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfe31fa74fb2b8dea;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/design_draft.md\u0007design_draft.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and let me know how you would like to proceed.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33;1m?\u001b[m Drafted Alternatives Considered in design_draft.md. Please review. How would you like to proceed?\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Approve Alternatives Considered and proceed to next section\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExploring\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(memmap_default.ld)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n⣯  \u001b[90mThe plan involves creating mu\u001b[94mltipl\u001b[90me files across different directories. These files, including `memmap_default.ld`...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: When reviewing a file edit, press f to see the full diff.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
