[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[33A\u001b[1m### Key Decisions & Additions\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mExhaustive 30-File Enumeration\u001b[m: Listed every file touched by the implementation (1 modified root \u001b[94mREADME.md\u001b[m and 29\r\n  created files across \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/\u001b[m and \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/apps/\u001b[m), including all EGM \u001b[94mREADME.md\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  contracts, \u001b[94mKconfig\u001b[m files, \u001b[94mMake.defs\u001b[m / \u001b[94mMakefile\u001b[m fragments, \u001b[94mdefconfig\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmemmap_default.ld\u001b[m, board\u001b[K\r\n  initialization/bringup C sources, and the \u001b[94mbargraph\u001b[m daemon/CLI implementation.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mActionable File-Level Specifications\u001b[m: Specified the exact Kconfig symbols in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mbargraph/board/configs/bargraph/defconfig\u001b[m, the register modifications in \u001b[94mrp23xx_bringup.c\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  (\u001b[94mRP23XX_PADS_BANK0_GPIO(26)\u001b[m and \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_DIV = 0x00FFFF00\u001b[m), the \u001b[94mapps/external\u001b[m symlink hook in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mbargraph/board/scripts/Make.defs\u001b[m, and the function breakdown in \u001b[94mbargraph_main."]
[0.000, "o", "c\u001b[m (\u001b[94mbargraph_compute_duties\u001b[m,\u001b[K\n\u001b[97D\u001b[94m_apply_pwm\u001b[m, \u001b[94mbargraph_shutdown_pwm\u001b[m, \u001b[94mbargraph_sample_adc\u001b[m, \u001b[94mbargraphd_daemon\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mbargraph_main\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mVerification Plan\u001b[m: Defined the build verification commands (\u001b[94mconfigure.sh\u001b[m + \u001b[94mmake\u001b[m), git submodule cleanliness\r\n  checks (\u001b[94mgit -C nuttx status --porcelain\u001b[m and \u001b[94mgit -C apps status --porcelain\u001b[m), pure transfer-function boundary\u001b[K\r\n  verification, and hardware-in-the-loop breadboard checks.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  Please review \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb919e0eff2275e58;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/design_draft.md\u0007design_draft.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and let me know how you would like to proceed.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33;1m?\u001b[m Drafted Detailed Implementation in design_draft.md. Please review. How would you like to proceed?\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Approve Detailed Implementation and proceed to next section\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 5m 7s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(I'm thinking through how to approach this.)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplor"]
