[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[32A  initialization/bringup C sources, and the \u001b[94mbargraph\u001b[m daemon/CLI implementation.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mActionable File-Level Specifications\u001b[m: Specified the exact Kconfig symbols in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mbargraph/board/configs/bargraph/defconfig\u001b[m, the register modifications in \u001b[94mrp23xx_bringup.c\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  (\u001b[94mRP23XX_PADS_BANK0_GPIO(26)\u001b[m and \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_DIV = 0x00FFFF00\u001b[m), the \u001b[94mapps/external\u001b[m symlink hook in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mbargraph/board/scripts/Make.defs\u001b[m, and the function breakdown in \u001b[94mbargraph_main.c\u001b[m (\u001b[94mbargraph_compute_duties\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mbargraph_apply_pwm\u001b[m, \u001b[94mbargraph_shutdown_pwm\u001b[m, \u001b[94mbargraph_sample_adc\u001b[m, \u001b[94mbargraphd_daemon\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mbargraph_main\u001b[m).\r\n  • \u001b[1mVerification Plan\u001b[m: Defined the build verification commands (\u001b[94mconfigure.sh\u001b[m + \u001b[94mmake\u001b[m), git submodule cleanliness\r\n  checks (\u001b[94mgit -C nuttx status --porcelain\u001b[m and \u001b[94mgit -C apps status --porcelain\u001b[m), pure transfer-function bound"]
